@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #4F5D75
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
title 异步读：需要等待的路径
participant "Session / 调用者" as app
participant "Socket Service" as service
participant "Reactor / epoll" as reactor
participant "Scheduler / Runner" as runner
participant "完成 Handler" as handler
app -> service : async_read_some(buffer, token)
service -> reactor : 注册读取 operation
service --> app : 发起函数返回
reactor -> reactor : 可读事件，尝试 recv
reactor -> runner : 可完成工作
runner -> service : operation.complete()
service -> handler : 经关联 Executor 交付 ec, n
handler -> app : 更新协议状态
note over app,handler
等待期间 buffer 必须有效
调用返回不是读取完成
end note
@enduml
